Fixes: 7bfe3b8ea6e3 ("Drivers: hv: Introduce mshv_vtl driver")
Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
Signed-off-by: Naman Jain <namjain@linux.microsoft.com>
Reviewed-by: Michael Kelley <mhklinux@outlook.com>
